\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} Connection to PropStep actions:}
\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} addProp cx cy csum (§6.6) is addPropagator.fn wrapped in IO:}
\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{}   it reads cx and cy, computes addFn, and merges into csum.}
\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} subProp csum cx cy wraps subPropagator.fn similarly.}
\PYG{c+c1}{\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} The Propagator2 instances certify that these IO actions are sound.}

